      "heading": {
        "text": "1. PROTECTION LAYER HIERARCHY VERIFICATION",
        "level": 1
      },
      "level": 1,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "For each SIF, the following hierarchy must hold: Normal Operating Value (NOV) < DCS Alarm < SIS Trip. A violation (where the trip setpoint is at or below the alarm setpoint, or the alarm setpoint is at or below NOV) represents a protection layer conflict.",
